19
00:00:29,218 --> 00:00:30,726
21 people died;

20
00:00:30,738 --> 00:00:32,734
about 150 were injured.

21
00:00:33,780 --> 00:00:35,643
The tank was never rebuilt.

22
00:00:35,679 --> 00:00:37,374
For decades, on hot summer

23
00:00:37,374 --> 00:00:39,092
days, the North End still

24
00:00:39,092 --> 00:00:40,798
